# What the types job checks the type hints with (ci.yml): the checker, and what the package imports that has type hints of its
# own (numpy) or stubs (pandas). The other libraries it imports (astropy, astroquery, ebf, h5py, pathos, vaex) have none that mypy
# finds: see [tool.mypy] in pyproject.toml. The stubs of pandas are those of the pandas that setup.py allows (2.x).
mypy
numpy
pandas-stubs<3
